    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc97Summer Clover\ud83d\udc97</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Undexpected Transfer...</h2>You are millions of dollars in debt and struggling to make ends meet as you toil away at your day job for a major conglomorate. Your life takes a frustrating turn for the worse when your colleagues repeatedly and falsely accuse you of sexual harassment. <br><br>In a twist of fate, your supervisor Shizuko proposed an undexpected job transfer\u2014A position as housekeeper at your employers' mansion! Along with a significant pay raise, you will also be given free room and board! <br><br>However, you'll be spending your time serving the owners of the mansion, who happen to be three unusually captivating sisters...<br><br>Prepare for a summer full of blush-worthy, heart-pounding escapades as you tend to the three sisters and your dependable supervisor.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458860/extras/9220888ca5ee6fa5295e08566bc0bb41.poster.avif?t=1735296194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458860/extras/9220888ca5ee6fa5295e08566bc0bb41.webm?t=1735296194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458860/extras/9220888ca5ee6fa5295e08566bc0bb41.mp4?t=1735296194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458860/extras/89f1df88a44c79b73db565694d858d6b.poster.avif?t=1735296194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458860/extras/89f1df88a44c79b73db565694d858d6b.webm?t=1735296194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458860/extras/89f1df88a44c79b73db565694d858d6b.mp4?t=1735296194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>Manage your time at the mansion as you venture through the lighthearted slice-of-life story.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Each character has their own fully-developed story<br></li><li> Japanese voice acting for the main female characters<br></li><li> An exciting array of events and CGs for you to discover<br></li><li> The aforementioned \u201cheart-pounding escapades\u201d will all be animated</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458860/extras/b7d79e30cdf139d864d023b6c3c44a5e.poster.avif?t=1735296194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458860/extras/b7d79e30cdf139d864d023b6c3c44a5e.webm?t=1735296194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458860/extras/b7d79e30cdf139d864d023b6c3c44a5e.mp4?t=1735296194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Kasumi: The eldest sister<br>She exudes the warm and nurturing aura of an elder sister. <br>Her caring nature is evident in her affection for Ayano and Shizuku. Yet, beneath that gentle facade lies a secret...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458860/extras/708c4bd3148e26082c1150519f8f5212.poster.avif?t=1735296194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458860/extras/708c4bd3148e26082c1150519f8f5212.webm?t=1735296194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458860/extras/708c4bd3148e26082c1150519f8f5212.mp4?t=1735296194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Ayano: The middle sister<br>With her contagious enthusiasm and go-getter attitude, his free-spirited girl seizes every opportunity that comes her way. However, beneath her sunny demeanor, she carries a hidden burden that no one knows about.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458860/extras/fa6ff4ba2942ed9cff5b664007031c89.poster.avif?t=1735296194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458860/extras/fa6ff4ba2942ed9cff5b664007031c89.webm?t=1735296194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458860/extras/fa6ff4ba2942ed9cff5b664007031c89.mp4?t=1735296194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Shizuku: The youngest sister<br>She may seem distant and reserved, but once you get to know her, she can be surprisingly playful and firtatious. She's engaged in a secret endeavor that her father disapproves.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458860/extras/e23e24324ed676d8b650f829967fe1e1.poster.avif?t=1735296194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458860/extras/e23e24324ed676d8b650f829967fe1e1.webm?t=1735296194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458860/extras/e23e24324ed676d8b650f829967fe1e1.mp4?t=1735296194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Shizuko: Your trusty friend &amp; supervisor<br>She's always been there for you through thick and thin. Together, you share a deep bond that extend beyond your work. Given your current predicament, how will your relationship evolve?",
